# Terminal speed on the 10% street. Where g sin(a) = Crr g cos(a) + k v^2, with asphalt Crr 0.018:
# standing (CdA 0.45) 15.4 m/s (55 km/h), crouched (CdA 0.30) 18.9 m/s (68 km/h). Wobble is switched
# off here to read drag alone. Each run starts at its terminal speed and holds it for 60 m.
park lab
cmd 0 setData physics.wobble.speed 99
cmd 0 setData physics.wobble.tuckSpeed 99
cmd 0 teleport lab_hill_ten
cmd 6 speed 15.4
cmd 400 teleport lab_hill_ten
cmd 406 speed 18.9
hold ollie 400..700
run 700
expect min skater.speed > 15.2 over 20..390
expect max skater.speed < 15.6 over 20..390
expect min skater.speed > 18.6 over 420..690
expect max skater.speed < 19.1 over 420..690
expect no event bail
